<title>CANADA: Paramount Resources to issue shares.</title>
<headline>Paramount Resources to issue shares.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY, Alberta 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paramount Resources Ltd said on Friday its board approved the issue of 500,000 common shares at C$20 per share through a flow-through private placement share offering for gross proceeds of C$10 million.</p>
<p>The company said subscriptions for the shares will only be accepted from full-time employees, including president C.H. Ridell, who is expected to be the major shareholder.</p>
<p>Paramount said it will use proceeds to help it meet its 1996-97 capital exploration and development program.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
